* many_outputs.sno -- regression for the dcftn brief
* "dcsno-static-program-size-limit". Pre-fix, programs above
* STMAX=256 statements silently truncated, corrupting control
* flow (`:(LABEL)` lookups landed on PC=0). After raising
* STMAX to 1024 + adding a compile-time overflow diagnostic,
* a 280-statement program must run end-to-end.
*
* This file has 280 OUTPUT statements followed by a sentinel.
* Expected: 280 'padN' lines, then 'DONE', then halt.
*
